Since a good artifact weapon gives more damage than grand master
martial arts, a monk would want to switch from martial arts to that
artifact when it arrives.  Issues - Which artifacts counts as "good"
and skill slot management.

In the end it means that at the start of the game you can't have any
knowledge of what your ending equipment will be.  Spend skill slots
early for extra survivability and it gives a bias to your later game.



